  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the Project is to create an efficient  institucional estructure to supervise the development of a sustainable, transparent and legaly secure forest management in Bolivia. The specific objectives are to assist Forestry Superintendence with the elaboration of a strategic plan and development efficient organizational and adminsitrative instruments.</narrative>
